> servation */
  4.                         egen C`var'_`x' = count(`var'_`x') /* number of ob
> servations */
  5.                         gen P`var'_`x' = (R`var'_`x' - 0.5)/C`var'_`x' /* 
> percentile score with a 0.5 correction in order to refer to the center of the
