. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * 
. 
.         * We test whether people having a daughter as the first child support
>  gender equality more than those having son as their first child
.         * We run a random effects model with:
.         * Dependent var: gender attitudes index
.         * Main predictor: first_daughter
.         * Controls: year of birth of the 1st child (centred on the grand mean
> )
.         
.         xtset pid syear

Panel variable: pid (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2012 to 2018, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

.         xtreg GEIndex first_daugh c.Cbrth_y_first##c.Cbrth_y_first , re clust
> er(pid)

